# hyprland-session.target — start for plain GDM-launched Hyprland sessions.
#
# Problem this solves: graphical-session.target has RefuseManualStart (only
# uwsm/desktop sessions may pull it), but plenty of user units REQUIRE it —
# xdg-desktop-portal.service has `Requisite=graphical-session.target` and
# vicinae hangs off it via WantedBy. Without this target a plain Hyprland
# session has no portals and no target-bound units (diagnosed live 2026-11).
#
# Pattern: the sway-session.target / hyprland-session.target recipe from the
# Hyprland wiki's systemd integration page. Started from hyprland.lua
# (hl.on("hyprland.start", ...)); BindsTo stops it with the target.
[Unit]
Description=Hyprland session (plain GDM launch)
Wants=graphical-session-pre.target graphical-session.target
After=graphical-session-pre.target
BindsTo=graphical-session.target
